The system is secured with multiple layers.

Users are authenticated.

Users are authorized.

Data is encrypted.

Access is controlled.

Actions are logged.

The system is monitored.

Vulnerabilities are managed.

Responsible disclosure is supported.

Incidents are responded to.

Breaches are notified.

Backups are taken.

Disaster recovery is planned.

Abuse is not permitted.

Spam is not permitted.

Harassment is not permitted.

Content is moderated.

Abuse is reported.

Security training is provided.

Compliance is maintained.

Third parties are reviewed.

The policy may be amended.

The policy is reviewed.

End of the Security and Abuse Policy.



